<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five stocks fell, two rose and six were flat in 6.9-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,576.6 points, 0.4 percent lower than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining 10 stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units were flat in a 7.1-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
